{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640, 480\n\nIMAGE LOAD 1, \u0022Graphics/hero.png\u0022     \n\nSPRITE ON 1\nSPRITE IMAGE 1,1,0\nSPRITE POS 1,300,240\n\nFOR I = 2 TO 10\n  SPRITE ON I\n  SPRITE IMAGE I,1,0\n  SPRITE GROUP I, \u0022enemy\u0022\n  SPRITE POS I,RND(640),RND(480)\nNEXT I\n\n\nrem SPRITE GROUP 6, \u0022bullet\u0022\n\nspriteX = 320\nspriteY = 240\n\nMainLoop:\n  CLSG\n\n  hit = HITGROUP(1,\u0022enemy\u0022)\n  IF hit \u003E 0 THEN\n    currhit = hit\n    PRINTG \u0022COLLISION!\u0022\n    PLAY EXPLOSION\n    SPRITE OFF hit\n    SPRITE UNGROUP hit, \u0022enemy\u0022\n  ENDIF\n \n  ; Analog r\u00F6relse med v\u00E4nster spak\n  spriteX = spriteX \u002B (JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftX\u0022) / 20)\n  spriteY = spriteY \u002B (JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftY\u0022) / 20)\n\n  ; H\u00E5ll inom sk\u00E4rmen\n  spriteX = MAX(0, MIN(640, spriteX))\n  spriteY = MAX(0, MIN(480, spriteY))\n\n  ; H\u00F6ger trigger = skjut\n  IF JOYAXIS(1, \u0022RT\u0022) \u003E 50 THEN GOSUB Shoot\n\n  PRINTG AT 0,8,INT(spriteX) \u0026 \u0022 - \u0022 \u0026 INT(spriteY) \u0026 \u0022 - \u0022 \u0026 currhit\n  PRINTG AT 0,9,INT(JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftX\u0022)) \u0026 \u0022 - \u0022 \u0026 INT(JOYAXIS(1, \u0022LeftY\u0022))\n  SPRITE POS 1, spriteX, spriteY \n\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop\n\n","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}